WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.905
Module 0.

00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:03.440
Crypto From Zero.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.125
Part of Stage 0, Zero.

00:00:06.425 --> 00:00:08.919
By the end of this module, you'll be able

00:00:08.919 --> 00:00:11.413
to go from never having owned crypto to a

00:00:11.413 --> 00:00:15.154
secured exchange account, a backed-up wallet, a first transfer

00:00:15.154 --> 00:00:17.710
and a first practice DeFi transaction.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:22.715
Ends with the **Day-1 Setup Kit** checklist.

00:00:22.715 --> 00:00:24.070
That's the standard.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:26.040
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.401
There are 8 lessons, starting with

00:00:29.401 --> 00:00:32.115
Money, ledgers and why blockchains exist.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:34.094
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:36.365
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:37.665 --> 00:00:39.341
If the topic is new to

00:00:39.341 --> 00:00:42.265
you, start with Mastery Starter 0.0.

00:00:42.265 --> 00:00:44.160
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.314
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:46.314 --> 00:00:48.445
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:48.445 --> 00:00:50.252
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:50.252 --> 00:00:52.285
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:53.585 --> 00:00:56.210
Let's begin, with lesson 0.0.
